# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

A game made with [Kubriko](https://github.com/pandulapeter/kubriko), created by Kubriko Creator.

This is a regular Kotlin Multiplatform project: open it in Kubriko Creator or in IntelliJ IDEA, whichever you prefer.

- Run it on desktop: `./gradlew run`
- Run it in a browser: `./gradlew wasmJsBrowserDevelopmentRun`

Actor types built in Kubriko Creator are stored in `.kubriko/actors`, and their Kotlin is generated into the `generated` package: edit
them in Kubriko Creator, since changes made to the generated files are overwritten. Scenes live in `src/commonMain/composeResources/files/scenes`. `GameEntryPoint` and the service file registering it in
`src/desktopMain/resources/META-INF/services` are what let Kubriko Creator edit them.
